OL,3,GNEWSAData centre plan 'further blow',
OL,4,Asay campaigners
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a huge data centre are a
OL,7,F"further blow" amid other proposals for
OL,8,Fsolar farms and battery storage sites
OL,9,Fnear villages, residents have said.
OL,11,FUS-based developer Tract wants to
OL,12,Fcreate the eight-building complex,
OL,13,Fwhich it calls Durham Technology Park,
OL,14,Fon land between the villages of South
OL,15,FHetton, Murton and Easington Lane in
OL,16,FCounty Durham.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
