OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAData centre plan 'further blow',
OL,4,Asay campaigners
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast Durham Action Group (EDAG) said
OL,7,Fits impact must be considered alongside
OL,8,Fexisting and proposed energy
OL,9,Finfrastructure, while South Hetton
OL,10,FParish Council chair Gillian Rodgers
OL,11,Fcalled the plans a "further blow" to
OL,12,Fthe community.
OL,14,FTract said it would listen "carefully"
OL,15,Fto concerns to find "acceptable ways"
OL,16,Fto mitigate the effects.
